raft-row-bisiq3h7n-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-row pagecraft-bisiq3h7n"><div id="pagecraft-column-bisiq3fol-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-column pagecraft-bisiq3fol"><div id="pagecraft-heading-bisiq3i1x-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-heading pagecraft-bisiq3i1x ts-eyebrow">v11</div><h3 id="pagecraft-heading-bisiq3jv8-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-heading pagecraft-bisiq3jv8 ts-subtitle">The global block retired</h3><div id="pagecraft-wysiwyg-bisiq3kt5-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-wysiwyg pagecraft-bisiq3kt5 ts-body"><p>Copies that pushed content over each other became components. A copy that had diverged keeps what it shows and stops being linked.</p></div></div></div><div id="pagecraft-column-bisiq3eiu-the-global-block-retired" class="pagecraft-column pagecraft-bisiq3eiu"></div></div></div></section><section id="export" class="pagecraft-section pagecraft-bisiq3mev"><div class="pagecraft-container"><div id="pagecraft-row-bisiq3p2z" class="pagecraft-row pagecraft-bisiq3p2z"><div id="pagecraft-column-bisiq3oqn" class="pagecraft-column pagecraft-bisiq3oqn"><h2 id="pagecraft-heading-bisiq3nko" class="pagecraft-heading pagecraft-bisiq3nko ts-title">What comes out</h2></div></div><div id="pagecraft-row-bisiq3siu" class="pagecraft-row pagecraft-bisiq3siu"><div id="pagecraft-column-bisiq3r4b" class="pagecraft-column pagecraft-bisiq3r4b"><div id="pagecraft-table-bisiq3qcw" class="pagecraft-table-wrap pagecraft-bisiq3qcw"><table class="pagecraft-table" data-rules="rows" data-zebra><caption>What an export writes</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">File</th><th scope="col">What it is</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">index.html</th><td>One per page, named by its slug — with the stylesheet inlined</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">work/acme.html</th><td>One per collection item, when a page is a template for one</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">assets/hero.webp</th><td>Your uploads, each written at several widths